--- !u!114 &114481512122738727
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1371728816921836}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 454
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 你屏息观察，约有一炷香后血煞老怪追着一团金色光影飞快掠过，那金色光影直接穿破禾山道修士凝成的灵力屏障，窜向山林深处。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114203303324784967
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1371728816921836}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 460
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 你定睛一看，一只头生三目的猴子跌落在地。它光滑柔顺的毛发，隐隐能看到浅淡的金光在毛发中流转。额正中的灵目也炯炯有神，灵慧的眸光似有实型般令人生畏。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
